<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-durability> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "EU DPP Textile Indicator Ontology. Version 1.1.2."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2026-03-06"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Elio Hbeich"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Ontology module for derived textile durability and use-related indicators. It separates indicators from assessment results, product characteristics, thresholds and quantitative values."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2026-03-06"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2026-07-16"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "EU DPP Textile Indicator Ontology"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "txtind" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator#" .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The module deliberately does not subclass dpp:QualityIndicator because the inspected DPP Core makes dpp:QualityIndicator a subclass of dpp:QuantitativeProperty. That pattern would conflate an indicator with the quantitative-value model rejected by the textile network."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This module models interpretive or calculated indicators. It does not treat a raw assessment result, a durability characteristic, a threshold or a quantitative value as an indicator."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EU DPP Textile Indicator Ontology"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-indicator> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "Version 1.1.2" .
